sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant DI as DigitalInvoice evidence gate
  participant PDF as Cleared PDF (future)
  participant Buyer as Buyer
  participant App as MBS360 (external)
  participant N as NRS verification service
  Note over DI,PDF: Only confirmed production evidence can be displayed as verified
  DI-->>PDF: Genuine IRN / CSID / QR [future after licensing]
  PDF-->>Buyer: Receive authentic cleared invoice [future]
  Buyer-->>App: Scan QR with external MBS360 [external workflow]
  App-->>N: Ask for verification [external workflow]
  N-->>App: Official verification result [external workflow]
  App-->>Buyer: Display result [external workflow]
  Note over PDF,N: Fictional/mock PDF QR is NOT an NRS verification credential
